WEBVTT

00:00:06.453 --> 00:00:12.249
Choose Videos in the side menu.

00:00:12.499 --> 00:00:18.094
Click Edit Staying Safe Online.

00:00:18.344 --> 00:00:24.344
Check that Before you publish
shows what is left to do.

00:00:26.399 --> 00:00:32.399
Check that Preview as viewer
is on the video screen.

00:00:34.251 --> 00:00:40.251
Click Preview as viewer.
